<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JO ROMA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot jo Roma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jo Roma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO ROMA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga pa Paulo bot Jo Roma nyutu miti pa Paulo me limo kanica matye i Roma. Paulo onongo mito mada me tic ikin lukricitayo matye kunu pi kare manok, wek bene gin otyel kore me citone wa i Spain. En ocoyo waraga man me tito kamaleng lok ma mako kom niye pa lukricitayo wa kit tic ki kwo pa lukricitayo bene. Buk man tye ki lok me Kwena Maber ma Paulo oryeyo kore kikore manen kamaleng.</para>
  <para style="ip">Inge mot bot dano ma i kanica matye i Roma ki tito pi legane pirgi, Paulo otito botgi bene lok ma pire tek i waraga man ni, “Kwena Maber nyutu yo ma Lubanga kwano dano ni kite atir. Man a ki i niye dok bene gik ki niye.” 1:17.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lacen Paulo otito lok ki tek cwiny wek gin guniang telok man. Kit ma rok ducu, kadi bed Lujudaya nyo rok mapatpat myero kikwan gi ni kitgi atir wek gin gucung kacel ki Lubanga, pien rok ducu tye i te twero me bal. Dano mo keken kikwano ni kite atir nia ki i niyene ma en keto ikom Yecu Kricito. Lacen Paulo otito telok man me kwo manyen ma a ki iribe ikom Kricito ma bino ki i kwo manyen i Lubanga. Ngat muye Kwena Maber bedo ki kuc i Lubanga dok bene Lubanga gonye woko ki itwero me bal ki to.</para>
  <para style="ip">I cura 5:1—8:39, Paulo bene tito telok ango ma oweko kiketo cik pa Lubanga obedo tye ki bene gin ma oweko tek pa Cwiny Maleng tye i kwo pa lukricitayo. Paulo bene omede katito lok ikit ma Lujudaya ki Rok mukene ducu tye kacel iyub pa Lubanga. En bene owaco ni Lujudaya gukwero Yecu pien yub pa Lubanga onongo tye me kelo Rok ducu ma iwi lobo me nywako kacel kica pa Lubanga matye i Yecu Kricito, dok bene en tye ki niye ni Lujudaya pe bikwero Yecu matwal. Gin bene biye Yecu Kricito macalo Lalargi. Me agikine Paulo otito kit ma lakricitayo myero okwo kwede, tutwale ikit me maro dano. En bene onyutu yo me tic pi Lubanga, ki kit ma lakricitayo myero otii pi lobone ki bot luwote, ki kit ma tamgi myero obed kwede. En odolo te waraga man kun coyo tam ma mere ki miyo pwoc bot Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lanyut ki guti me lok <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kit me lar <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1:18—3:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yo me lare ma a ki bot Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3:21—4:25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwo manyen i Kricito <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5:1—8:39</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jo Icrael i yub pa Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9:1—11:36</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yo me kwo pa Lakricitayo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1—15:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ladol lok ki mot <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15:14—16:27</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Waraga man oa ki bot Paulo ma en latic pa Yecu Kricito, ma Lubanga olwongo me bedo lakwena, ka dong kimiye tic me tito lok me Kwena Maber ma oa ki bot Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Lok me Kwena Maber onongo yam Lubanga ociko pire con ilok ma lunebi yam gutito, dok bene onongo kicoyo woko i ginacoya maleng. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Lok me Kwena Maber man kicoyo okemo Wode. Ikit me kom, Wode man yam kinywale ikin likwayo pa Daudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />ento pi Cwiny Maleng, Lubanga onyutu en obedo Wode pi tek ma ocere kwede ki ikin jo ma oto, en aye Yecu Kricito Rwotwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Pire omiyo wan walimo kica pa Lubanga, ki tic me bedo lukwena wek wamii dano ma i rok ducu gubed luwiny pi niyegi inyinge; <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />ma wun bene wutye ikin gi, wun dano madong kilwongowu me bedo jo pa Yecu Kricito.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Bot wun jo ducu ma wutye i Roma ma Lubanga marowu, dok olwongowu me bedo jone maleng ma en aye oyero.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Lubanga Wonwa ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito omiwu kica ki kuc.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega me miyo pwoc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Mukwongo apwoyo Lubangana i Yecu Kricito pi wun ducu, pien niyewu dong kitucu pire oromo wi lobo woko ducu. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Lubanga ma aworo ki icwinya kun bene atito lok me Kwena Maber ikom Wode, en aye cadena ma ngeyo ni atucu nyingwu ilegana ikare ducu ma pe akeng. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Alego ni ka twere, ka Lubanga oye, olo myero anong yo me bino botwu ikare ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Atye kaparo me nenowu mada, wek apok botwu mot mogo me cwiny me jingowu wek wubed matek. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Gin ma aloko en aye ni wun kacel ki an wabikonye lawangacel; en aye ni niyena bikonyowu, ki niyewu bene bikonya.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:21">Tic 19:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Gin ma amito wunge, utmegina, en aye ni onongo abedo kamito tyen mapol ni myero abin botwu, (kadi wa onyo bene gin mo pud tye ma kagenga bino woko), wek alok jo mogo ikinwu me ye Yecu kit ma atimo ikin Lurok mukene ducu. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Atye ki banya bot Lugrik ki bot Lurok ma gin kwiya piny, bot luryeko ki bot luming. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Man aye gin ma omiyo atye ki miti me tito lok me Kwena Maber botwu bene wun jo ma wubedo i Roma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Teko matye i Kwena Maber</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Lewic pe maka pi lok me Kwena Maber, ma en aye teko pa Lubanga ma laro jo matye ki niye, mukwongo Lujudaya, ka dong Lugrik bene. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Kab 2:4</ref></char></note> Pien lok me Kwena Maber nyutu kit ma Lubanga kwano ni dano bedo ma kite atir, ma man time pi niye keken, cake ki i acakine nio kwede wa i agikine. Kit macalo kicoyo ni, “Dano ma kite atir pi niye bibedo kwo.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bal pa dano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Pien dong akemo pa Lubanga onyute woko ki ipolo kun bino ikom jo ma lutim maracu ducu ma pe gin woro Lubanga, ma gin tye kagengo lok ada ni pe otii tic, pi timgi maracuni. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Pien gin ma dano twero ngeyone ikom Lubanga dong onen woko kamaleng botgi, Lubanga kikome aye onyutu botgi. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Nicake ikare ma kicweyo lobo, kit pa Lubanga ma onongo pe nen, ma en aye tekone ma pe gik, ki dit ma en Lubanga tye kwede dong onen woko, kun kingeye nia ki i jami ducu ma en otiyo. Ma omiyo dano dong pe gitye ki lok mo ma myero gin opid pi gengo ngegi. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:17">Epe 4:17</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 4:18">18</ref> </char></note> Pien kadi bed onongo yam gin ngeyo Lubanga, ento pe guwore macalo Lubanga, pe bene gupwoye, ento tamgi odwokogi igin ma pe konyo, ki tam ma i cwinygi me mingomingo bene dong ocido woko odoko col. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Gin lwonge ken gi ni gin luryeko, ento gin guloke gudoko luming. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Nwo 4:16-18</ref></char></note> Ci gin guloko deyo pa Lubanga ma pe to woko, kun giporo ki cal pa dano ma to, nyo ki cal pa winyo, nyo pa lee, nyo pa twol gu. <figure style="fig" alt="People worshiping an idol" file="4600123.TIF" size="col" copy="Ane Voltan" ref="1:23">Dano giworo cal</figure><verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />En ma omiyo Lubanga otenyogi woko liyak imiti me caro matye i cwinygi, wek gin gubal kwede deyo me komgi keken gi. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Gin guloko ada mamako kom Lubanga woko ki goba, kun guworo dok gutiyo bot ginacweya, ma ka woro ki tic bot Lacwec, ma pwoc myero kimii bote nakanaka! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Pi tyen lok man omiyo Lubanga otenyogi itamgi ma ogom ma gin tamo makelo lewic. Kadi wa mon gi bene guweko bedo ki co ikit ma kinywalogi ni gin gubed kwedeni, ento dok gucako butu ki mon wadigi. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ki co bene kitmeno guweko bedo ki mon woko ikit ma kinywalogi ni myero gubed kwedeni, ento cwinygi puke ikom co wadigi, ma gimito ni gibut ki co wadgi, ma meno tim me lewic mada, pimeno gin gilimo can malit ikomgi ken gi pi kit balgi meno.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Dong kit macalo gin pe guneno gin mo ma konyogi ingeyo Lubangani, Lubanga bene otenyogi woko itamgi ma konye pekeni, wek dong gutim gin ma pe myero. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Gin onongo yam gupong ki kwayi bal mapol, tim maracu, woro me lim, ki rac cwiny. Gupong bene ki cwiny me nyeko, nek, daa, goba, ki kwarcwiny, dok gin bene lukwot dano, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />luyet dano, dok jo ma dag Lubanga. Gubedo lungala, jo ma lyere, jo ma wake, lurot kit me timo tim maracu, jo ma pe winyo lunyodogi. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Gin jo ma gikwiya piny, jo ma pe gene, pe gitye ki mar i cwinygi, kica bene pe makogi ikom dano. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Kadi bed gin ngeyo cik pa Lubanga ni jo ma timo gin macalo meno myero kinekgi woko, ento gin pe gitimo jami macalo meno atima keken, kono gin gipwoyo apwoya bene jo matye katimone.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:1">Mat 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luk 6:37</ref></char>
    </note> Pimeno, gin mo ma myero ipid pire dong peke, kadi in anga, ka ingolo kop ikom dano lawoti. Pien pi kop ma ingolo ikom dano mukene ca, nongo dong ingolo kop oloyi woko, pien in langolkop ki komi bene itimo kit gin acelu. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Wan wangeyo ni Lubanga ngolo kop atir dok kakare ka ongolo kop oloyo jo ma gitimo gin macalo meno. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Dong in dano ma ingolo kop ikom jo mukene ma gitimo gin macalo menoni, kun in kikomi bene itimo, itamo ni ibibwot ki ingolo kop pa Lubanga? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Nyo icayo kica pa Lubanga ki kit ma en juke kwede pi bal pa dano, ki kit ma en diyo kwede cwinye? Adada in ingeyo ni kica pa Lubanga tye me teli wek ingut ikom bali. <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ento pi nganga ma icwinyi, ma idag ngut kwede ni, itye kakano giri akemo pa Lubanga ikomi keni ma bibino inino me akemo, ikare ma kibinyutu iye ngolo kop ma atir pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Jab 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Car 24:12</ref></char></note> Lubanga biculu dano acel acel kun lubu kit tic ma dano meno otiyo. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />En bimiyo kwo ma pe tum bot jo ma gudiyo cwinygi kun gicane me tiyo gin maber, pi yenyo deyo ki woro, ki kwo ma bedo naka. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ento bot jo ma giparo pirgi ken gi, ma pe gilubu lok ada, ento gilubu gigi kit marac, Lubanga biculugi kun onyo akemone ki kinigane mager atika ikomgi. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Can ki remcwiny bidiyo dano ducu ma timo gin marac, mukwongo Lujudaya ka dong jo Grik bene. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ento dano ducu ma timo gin maber gin binongo deyo ki woro ki kuc, mukwongo Lujudaya ka dong jo Grik bene. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Nwo 10:17</ref></char></note> Pien Lubanga gire pe ki apokapoka ikin dano pi kit ma dano tye kwede.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Jo ma gutimo bal labongo Cik pa Moses, gibito labongo cik bene; ento jo ma gutimo bal ite Cik, kibingolo kop ikomgi kun lubu Cik. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Pien pe jo ma winyo lok me Cik awinya ki itgi aye jo ma kitgi atir inyim Lubanga, ento jo ma gitiyo gin ma Cik mito aye kibikwanogi ni gin jo ma kitgi atir. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ka Lurok ma gin peke ki Cik pa Moses gitiyo gin ma Cik mito pi kitgi ma kinywalogi kwede, meno nongo dong gin kikomgi gitye ki Cik i cwinygi, kadi bed Cik pe kimiyo botgi. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Ginyutu ni gin ma cik mito dong kicoyo woko i cwinygi, dok ngec ma gitye kwede ma nyutu botgi balgi bene aye bedo caden tye ada, kun tamgi bedo kayoke ayoka; mogo ngolo ni kop oloyogi, ki mogo nongo cwakogi acwaka. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Bibedo kitmeno inino meno ma Lubanga bingolo kop ikom dano pi gin ma gutiyo i mung, mamiyo Yecu Kricito aye ngolo, kun lubu lok me Kwena Maber ma atye katitoneni.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lujudaya ki Cik pa Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Ento ka ilwonge keni ni in Lajudaya, kun ijenge ikom Cik, dok bene iwake pi Lubanga, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />dok bene ingeyo gin ma en mito, dok ipwoyo gin maber makato, pien dong kipwonyi woko ki lok mamako cik, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />dong ki tung boti, in ingeyo ni in latel lutowang, in dero ma menyo dano ma gitye ipiny macol, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />dok bene in aye ma tiro luming, in lapwony pa lutino, pien itye ki ngec ma oromo ki lok ada mamako Cik kikome. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Dong in lapwony ma ipwonyo jo mukene, pe ipwonye kekeni bo? Itito lok ni, “Pe ikwal”, in kono omyero ikwal kwo? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Itito ni, “Pe i tim abor”, in kono myero itim abor? Cwinyi dag woro jogi, ento in omyero ikwal gin matye i ot jok? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Iwake pi Cik, ento ituru Cik kun icayo Lubanga? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Ica 52:5</ref></char></note> Tye kit macalo yam kicoyo iginacoya ni, “Kiyeto nying Lubanga ikin Lurok pirwu.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Lire konyo kace ilubu Cik, ento ka ituru cik, dwoki cen ibedo calo pe onongo kiliri. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Dong ka inen dano ma pe kiliro olubu gin ma kiciko matye i Cik, dano ma pe kilironu pe kibikwane calo ngat ma kiliro? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Meno miyo dano ma pe kilirogi, ma gilubu Cik, bingolo kop loyi, pien itye ki Cik mayam dong kicoyo woko acoya, dok bene kiliri, ento pud ituru Cik. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Pien dano manen Lajudaya ki woko keken meno pe Lajudaya kikome; dok bene lire manen ki woko ikom, meno pe lire kikome. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Nwo 30:6</ref></char></note> Lajudaya kikome aye dano ma bedo Lajudaya ki i cwinye, dok bene lire me ada aye lire ma dano bedo kwede ki i cwinye, ma en aye tic pa Cwiny Maleng, pe nukuta ma kicoyo acoya. Dong ngat macalo meno kadi bed dano pe gipwoye, ento Lubanga pwoye.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Ka dong tye kitmeno, ci Lajudaya kato jo mukeneni ki gin ngo? Nyo kony me lire kono tye ka kwene? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Konyo matek i yo ducu. Mukwongo, Lujudaya yam kimiyo botgi lok pa Lubanga ma pire tek kun kigenogi ni gibigwoko. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Lok man bedo ningning ka jo mogo ikin Lujudaya onongo yam gin pe gigene? Kit macalo gin pe geneni, itamoni man bene twero miyo Lubanga doko ngat ma pe gene? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Jab 51:4</ref></char></note> Pe kitmeno! Lubanga tye ki ada, kadi bed dano ducu lugoba, kit macalo kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Wek gin ma iloko onyut ni kiti atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">dok bene wek ilo lok ka kingolo kop ikomi.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ento ka kitwa ma pe atirni nyutu ni kit Lubanga tye atir, ci wan dok wabiwaco lok ango? Wabiwaco mono ni Lubanga pe kite atir pi keto akemone ikomwa? (Man atye kalok ikit pa dano.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Pe kitmeno! Ka Lubanga pe kite atir pi keto akemo ikomwa, ci en twero ngolo kop ikom dano ma gibedo iwi lobo ningning? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Kace gobanani miyo ada pa Lubanga mede ameda kun bene kelo deyo bote, ci pingo pud dok kingolo kop ikoma calo an labalo? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Pingo pe dong watim gin marac wek gin maber oa iye? Pien tye jo mogo ma gicoko dogwa ki lok goba ma giwaco ni wan waloko kitmeno. Ka kingolo kop oloyo jo macalo meno nongo kingolo kakare.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngat mo ma kite atir peke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Man teloke ango doki? Wan Lujudaya mono watye maber makato Lurok woko? Pe wa ki acel; pien dong anyutu woko i loka me adot ni, Lujudaya ki jo Grik ducu bal dong oloyogi woko. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Jab 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">Jab 53:1-3</ref></char></note> Kit macalo yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Ngat mo ma kite atir peke, kadi ki acel!<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Ngat mo ma niang bene peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">ngat mo ma yenyo Lubanga bene peke.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Gin ducu dong gungak woko, gudoko jo ma kitgi racu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">pe tye ngat mo ma tiyo gin maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">peke kadi ki acel.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:9">Jab 5:9</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 140:3">Jab 140:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Gungamo doggi calo bur lyel ma twolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">kun giloko lok mamit me bwolo dano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Lok ma giloko obedo calo kwir pa ororo.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:7">Jab 10:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lokgi ducu ma giloko obedo lok makec ma giceno ki dano acena.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:7">Ica 59:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:8">8</ref> </char>
    </note> Tyengi yot giringo kwede madwir kaneko dano.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Balo lobo ki cwercwiny keken aye tye i yogi ducu;<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />pe gingeyo yo me kuc.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:1">Jab 36:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pe bene gilworo Lubanga.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Kombedi dong wangeyo ni gin ma Cik oloko, loko bot jo matye ite Cik, wek dano ducu gubed labongo lageng ngegi. Wek wi lobo ducu obed ite ngolo kop pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Jab 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2:16</ref></char></note> Pien pe kibikwano dano mo ni kite atir inyim Lubanga pi lubu Cik; pien Cik tice aye me niango dano wek gunge balgi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano kikwano ni kite atir pi niye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ento kombedi kit ma Lubanga kwano ki dano ni kite atir dong onen woko kamaleng, ni pe a ki ilubu Cik. Kadi bed onongo Cik pa Moses ki coc pa lunebi bene yam otito pire. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Lubanga kwano dano ni kite atir pi niyene ikom Yecu Kricito, dok bene en tiyo kitmeno pi jo ducu ma ye Kricito, labongo apokapoka mo. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Pien dano ducu gubalo, dok pe gio ikom deyo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Lubanga kwanogi ni kitgi atir macalo mot, ma omiyo ki gin pi kit ma Yecu olarogi kwede. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Lubanga oketo Yecu me bedo gin kok me kwanyo bal ki remone, pi jo ma ye en, wek enyut kwede kite ma atirni, pien Lubanga yam ojuke kene, pe otimo gin mo ikom bal mayam dano gutimo con. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Lubanga onyut kit ma atir ikare man, ni en kikome kite atir, dok en kwano dano ni kite atir pi ye Yecu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Ka wakewa kono dong tye kwene? Peke. Pi gwoko Cik? Pe kitmeno gire, ento pi kit me niye. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ma omiyo wamoko tamwa ni dano kikwano ni kite atir pi niyene, ento pe pi tic me cobo Cik. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Onyo Lubanga mono tye pi Lujudaya keken? Pe en bene Lubanga pa Lurok? Eyo, adada, en bene Lubanga pa Lurok. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Nwo 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gal 3:20</ref> </char></note> Pien Lubanga tye acel, en bikwano dano ma kilirogi ni kitgi atir pi niyegi, dok bene bikwano jo ma pe kilirogi ni kitgi atir pi niyegi. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Wan mono watye kabolo Cik pa Moses woko piman? Pe kumeno wa ki acel, wan giwa wamoko Cik amoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lanyut ikom Abraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Wan mono wabiwaco lok ango ikom Abraim, ma en kwarowani? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Kono yam kikwano Abraim ni kite atir pi tic ma en otiyo, kono onongo en tye ki gin mo ma en nyate pire, ento pe inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Aca 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal 3:6</ref></char></note> Dong coc mayam kicoyo iginacoya waco lok ango? Ginacoya waco ni, “Abraim onongo tye ki niye ikom Lubanga, omiyo kikwane ni en dano ma kite atir.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Dano ma tiyo tic pe kimiye mucarane macalo mot, ento kimiye macalo jami ma en otiyo pire. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ento dano matye ki niye ma pe jenge ikom tice ma en tiyo, kun ye Ngat ma kwano jo ma pe lworo Lubanga ni kitgi atir pi niyegi, kit dano macalo meno aye kikwano ni kite atir pi niyene. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />I kit acelu, Daudi bene yam oloko pi yomcwiny ma dano tye kwede, ka Lubanga okwane ni en dano ma kite atir labongo tic mo ma en otiyo, macalo yam kicoyo ni,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:1">Jab 32:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 32:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> “Jo madong kiweko balgi gitye ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">ma balgi bene dong kikwanyo woko;<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />dano ma Rwot dong pe kwano bal mo ikome tye ki yomcwiny.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Yomcwiny man mono tye pi jo ma kilirogi, nyo pi jo ma pe kilirogi bene? Ginacoya wawaco ni, pi niye omiyo kikwano Abraim ni kite atir. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Onongo mono yam kikwano ikome ningning? Onongo mono kikwane ma pud pe kilire, nyo lacen ma onongo dong kityeko lire woko? Pe madong kityeko lire, ento ma pud peya kilire. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Aca 17:10</ref></char></note> Kimiye lire macalo lanyut onyo lanen ma nyutu ni kikwane ni kite atir pi niyene ma onongo peya kilire. Meno miyo Abraim bedo kwaro dano ducu ma giye ma peya kilirogi, wek gin bene kikwangi ni kitgi atir. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Abraim bene kwaro pa jo ma kilirogi, pe pa dano ma kilirogi alira keken, ento pa jo ma kilirogi ma gilubu bene niye mayam kwarowa Abraim obedo kwede ma onongo pud pe kilire.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cike pa Lubanga cobe pi niye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Aca 17:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gal 3:29</ref></char>
    </note> Cike ma onongo yam Lubanga ociko bot Abraim ki likwaye ni, wi lobo ducu bibedo meggi. Lubanga yam ociko man, pe ni Abraim yam olubu Cik, ento ni en onongo oketo niyene ikom Lubanga, ka dong kikwane ni kite atir. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:18">Gal 3:18</ref></char></note> Kace jo ma lubu Cik gin aye jo ma wi loboni ducu bedo meggi, kono niye dong konye peke, ki cike bene kono konye peke. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Pien Cik miyo akemo mako Lubanga ikom dano, ento kama cik pe iye, turu cik bene peke.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gal 3:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Meno aye gin ma omiyo cike pa Lubanga ocung ikom niye, wek obed me kica, dok pi moko cikene bot likwayo pa Abraim ducu, pe bot jo ma lubu Cik keken, ento kadi wa bot jo ma gibedo ki niye macalo Abraim. Pien en kwarowa ducu, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Aca 17:5</ref> </char></note> kit macalo yam kicoyo ni, “Dong aketi wek ibed kwaro rok mapol.” Cike man dong kimoko inyim Lubanga mayam Abraim oyeni, en Lubanga mamiyo kwo ikom jo ma oto, dok bene ma lwongo gin mogo mayam komgi peke miyo gibedo tye. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Aca 15:5</ref></char></note> Abraim yam oye, kun onongo oketo gene ikom gin manen calo pe kitwero geno, omiyo en odoko kwaro rok mapol, kit macalo yam kicoyo ni, “Likwayu bibedo mapol macalo lakalatwer.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Aca 17:17</ref> </char></note> En pe obedo nyap iniyene kadi bed en onongo oneno ni kome dong romaroma ki gin ma oto, pien mwakane onongo dong cok romo miya acel kulu, dok bene medo ikom meno, dakone Cara onongo lalur. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Niyene pe odok cen, dok bene en pe obedo kacabe acaba itame ikom cike pa Lubanga, ento niyene omede ameda odoko matek, kun en miyo deyo bot Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Abraim onongo tye ki niye matut i cwinye ni, Lubanga twero tiyo gin ma ocike pire. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Pi niyene “omiyo kikwane ni en dano ma kite atir.”<verse eid="ROM 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Ento lok man ni, “omiyo kikwane” onongo pe kicoyo pi en kene, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />ento kicoyo pi wan bene. Wan bene kibikwanowa ni kitwa atir, wan jo madong waketo niyewa ikom Lubanga mayam ocero Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ki ikin jo ma oto ni. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Ica 53:4</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:5">5</ref></char></note> Yecu mayam kineko pi balwa, Lubanga ocere woko wek kikwanwa ni kitwa atir.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Adwogi kwano dano ni kite atir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Pimeno, kit macalo kikwanowa ni kitwa atir pi niye, watye dong ki kuc ikinwa ki Lubanga, pi Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Pire omiyo kiyabo botwa yo me limo kica man ma ocung pi niyeni, kun wabedo ki yomcwiny pi gen ma watye kwede me nywako deyo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Makato meno, wabedo ki yomcwiny i can mapatpat ma poto ikomwa, kun wangeyo ni bedo ki can kelo diyo cwiny me ciro can, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />diyo cwiny iciro can weko kipwoyo kitwa, ka dong pwoyo kitwani miyo wabedo ki gen. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Genwa meno pe kelo botwa cwercwiny, pien Cwiny Maleng madong kimiyo botwa omiyo kionyo mar pa Lubanga woko icwinywa.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Pien ikare mayam pud wagoro ma pe watwero konye kenwa, ka kare ma Lubanga oyero dong oromo, ci Kricito oto pi lubalo. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Tek tutwal bot dano mo me to pi ngat mo ma kite atir. Gwok nyo ka obedo dano ma kite ber, ci ngat mo twero diyo cwinye me to pire. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ento Lubanga onyutu kit ma en marowa kwede kit man ni, ikare ma wan pud lubalo Kricito yam oto pirwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Kit macalo kikwanowa woko ikare man ni kitwa atir pi remone ni, dong makato tutwale wabilare pire ki ikom akemo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ikare ma onongo wan pud lukwor pa Lubanga, en odwokowa cen bote pi to pa Wode. Makato meno, kit madong kidwokowa cen bote me doko luremeni, wabilare tutwale pi kwo pa Wode. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Pe meno keken, ento watye ki yomcwiny i Lubanga pi Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, pien en aye ma omiyo kidwokowa cen bot Lubanga me bedo lureme.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adam ki Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:6">Aca 3:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Pimeno, kit macalo bal yam obino i lobo kun wok ki ikom dano acel, ka dong to obino pi bal, kitmeno bene to onya oromo kin dano ducu, pien dano ducu gubalo. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Bal onongo tye i lobo con ma peya kimiyo cik, ento kama cik pe iye, bal bene pe gikwano iwi ngat mo. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ento to ocako loc ki ikom Adam oo kwede wa ikom Moses, ci oloyo jo mayam pe gutimo bal marom ki bal pa Adam, mayam oturu cik ma kimiye. Adam aye lanyut ma cimo Kricito ma obinoni.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ento mot me kica ma Lubanga omiyo pe rom ki bal pa Adam. Pien kadi bed dano mapol yam guto pi bal pa ngat acel ca, ento kica pa Lubanga ki mot me nono ma obino pi kica pa Yecu Kricito, obedo dit makato, dok onya oromo lwak dano mapol ata. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Dok mot me nono pe rom ki bal pa Adam ca, pien pi bal pa Adam acel ca omiyo kingolo kop oloyo dano ducu, ento tic me kica ma obino inge bal mapol okelo agonya. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Kace pi bal pa Adam aceli omiyo to obedo kaloc pi bale, ci dong jo ma gulimo kica mabup, ki mot me nono ma omiyo kikwanogi ni kitgi atir, gibibedo kwo kun nongo gitye kaloc pi dano acel, en Yecu Kricito.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Dong kit macalo bal pa ngat acel omiyo kop oloyo dano ducu, kitmeno bene tic me kit ma atir pa dano acel okelo agonya i kwo pa jo ducu. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Pien macalo pi dano acel ma pe obedo ki winy omiyo dano mapol ata gudoko lubalo, kitmeno bene pi winy pa dano acel jo mapol ata kibikwanogi ni kitgi atir. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ikare ma kimiyo Cik bal onya iye; ento kama bal onya iye, en aye bene kama kica onya iye makato ducu. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Kitmeno, kit macalo bal yam oloyo loc ci okelo to, kica bene oloyo loc ci omiyo kikwano dano ni kitgi atir, wek omii gunong kwo ma pe tum, pi Yecu Kricito Rwotwa.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">To ki tung bot bal ki kwo tung bot Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Wan mono dok wabiwaco ango? Myero wamede ki timo bal wek kica onya? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Pe kitmeno! Pien wan madong yam wato woko ki tung bot bal dok watwero bedo kwo i bal ningning? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Pe wungeyo ni wan ducu ma kityeko batijawa me donyo i Kricito onongo kibatijawa me donyo wa itone bene? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2:12</ref> </char></note> Kiyikowa kacel ki Kricito i to i batija ma walimo, wek wabed calo en. En yam ocer woko ki ikin jo ma oto pi deyo pa Wone, wek wan bene dong wanong kwo manyen.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Pien ka dong waribe kacel kwede i to mo ma cal ki toneni, kitmeno bene wabiribe kwede i cer ma cal ki cer ma kicero en kwedeni. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Pien wangeyo man ni, kwowa macon ca yam kigure kwede kacel ikom yatariya, wek kwo me bal ma onongo watye kwede ogik woko, wek wan dok pe wadok opii me bal. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Pien ngat ma oto, nongo dong kigonyo woko ki ite twero me bal. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Ento ka dong wato kacel ki Kricito, waye ni wabibedo kwo kacel kwede bene. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Pien wangeyo ni Kricito mayam dong ocer ki ikin jo ma otoni pe dok bito; to dong peke ki loc mo ikome. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />To ma en oto, oto pi bal, tyen acel keken, ento kwo ma en kwo kwede, kwo pi Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />I yo acelu, wun bene kitmeno myero wukwane kekenwu ni, wun jo ma oto tung bot bal, ento wubedo kwo kacel ki Lubanga.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Pe wuwek bal oloo komwu ma to wokoni, wek pe omii wubed kalubu miti me komwu. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Pe dok wumii dul komwu mapatpat itimo bal, macalo jami tic me tiyo gin marac; ento wumiine kenwu bot Lubanga calo jo ma gua woko ki i to, madong guo i kwo. Wumii dul komwu ducu bot Lubanga me tiyo gin matye atir. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Pien bal pe dok bibwoyowu, pien wun dong pe wutye ite cik, ento wutye ite kica pa Lubanga.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opii me kit ma atir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Gin ango dok kono? Dok wamede watimu bal, pien ni wa peke ite cik ento ite kica? Pe kitmeno gire! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Pe wungeyo ni ka dong wumiine kenwu bot ngat mo calo opii me winyo gin ma en loko, nongo dong wudoko opii pa ngat ma wuwinyo lokeni? Nyo wudoko opii me bal ma terowu i to, nyo wudoko opii me winyo lok pa Lubanga, ma telowu ikit ma atir. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ento wamiyo pwoc bot Lubanga, pien yam wubedo opii me bal, ento dong wutye kalubu kit pwony ma kipwonyowu kwede ni wulube ki cwinywu ducu. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Dong kityeko gonyowu woko ki i opii me bal, wudoko opii me kit ma atir. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Atye kalok macalo dano adana, pi gorowu ma kinywalowu kwede. Pien macalo yam wumiyo dul komwu ducu me bedo opii me tim caro ki tim maracu, omiyo dong wudoko lutim maracu, kombedi dong wumii dul komwu ducu gubed opii me kit ma atir, wek wudok jo maleng.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ikare ma onongo pud wubedo opii me bal, onongo pe wubedo ite loc me kit ma atir. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Yam wunongo gin ango maber ikom gin ma lewice kombedi tye ka makowu iyeni? Agiki pa jami macalo meno ducu aye to. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Kombedi dong kigonyowu woko ki i opii me bal, dong wudoko opii pa Lubanga; gin ma wunongo en aye ni wudoko dong jo maleng, agikine en kwo ma pe tum. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Pien mucara me bal en to, ento mot ma Lubanga miyowa nono, en aye kwo ma pe tum i Yecu Kricito Rwotwa.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Lanyut ma kikwanyo ki ikom nyom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Utmegina, atye kalok ki jo ma gingeyo cik; pe wungeyo ni cik mako dano ka pud kwo keken? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Dako ma kinyomo bene cik tweyo ikom cware ka cware pud kwo, ento ka cware dong oto, en gonye woko icik me nyom. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ma omiyo ka cware pud kwo, ce dakonu oa okobo woko bot laco mukene, kibilwonge ni latim abor. Ento ka cware dong oto, en nongo ogonye woko ki icik meno; ka dok onyome ki laco mukene nongo pe otimo abor.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Kumeno, utmegina, wun bene yam kigonyowu woko ki i Cik pa Moses pi to pa Kricito ma wuribe ikomeni, wek wudok bot ngat mukene, en aye ngat mayam kicere woko ki ikin jo ma oto, wek wutii gin maber bot Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Pien ikare mayam pud watye i kwo me anywali, gin maracu me bal ma cik dong otugu woko onongo tye katic i dul komwa mapatpat me tiyo tic ma terowa i to. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ento kombedi dong kigonyowa woko ki ikom cik, dong wato ki tung bot gin ma con omakowa. Omiyo wan dong watye katic i yo manyen me Cwiny, pe dok i yo macon ca me lubu cik mayam kicoyoni.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ki Bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:17">Nia 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Nwo 5:21</ref> </char>
    </note> Wabiwaco lok ango mono? Cik mono bal? Pe kitmeno gire! Ento kono yam Cik pe obedo tye, onongo kono gira pe angeyo bal. Ka kono yam Cik pe owaco ni, “Cwinyi pe opuke ikom jami pa ngat mukene,” kono onongo bene pe abedo ki ngec macalo meno. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ento bal onongo kare odonyo i Cik ca, ka dong ocako kelo kwayi miti ducu me puke cwiny icwinya. Pien ka Cik pe, ci bal to woko. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Yam onongo abedo kwo labongo Cik, ento ikare ma Cik ca obino, bal ocako bedo kwo, ci oweko ato woko. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Cik pa Moses kikome onongo myero okel kwo, ento dok okelo to bota. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Aca 3:13</ref> </char></note> Pien bal onongo kare odonyo i Cik, ci obwola, ka dong oneka woko. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Pimeno, Cik leng, ki gin ma kiciko bene leng, tye atir, dok ber bene.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ento gin mayam ber ca aye dok okelo to ikoma? Pe kitmeno! Bal aye onongo ma omiyo ato, kun tiyo ki gin maber, wek omii onen woko kamaleng ni meno bal enu. Kitmeno gin ma kiciko ca omiyo bal odoko marac mukato kare.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atelatela ma i cwiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Wangeyo ni Cik a ki i cwiny pa Lubanga; ento an a dano ma miti me kom telo ma kicato woko macalo opii bot bal. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal 5:17</ref> </char></note> Gin ma atiyogu ducu pe aniang iye. Pien gin ma amito pe atiyo, ento dok atiyo gin mogo ma pe amitoni. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Dong ka atiyo gin ma pe amito, nongo aye ni Cik ber. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Meno dong pe an aye ma atiyo, ento bal ma bedo i iya aye ma tiyo gire. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Pien angeyo ni gin mo maber pe ma bedo i iya, ma en aye kwona me anywali pa dano. Atwero mito gin ma atir, ento pe atwero tiyone. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Pien pe atiyo gin maber ma amitoni, ento gin marac ma pe amitoni aye dok atiyo. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Ci ka atiyo gin ma pe amitoni, meno dong nongo pe an aye ma atiyo, ento nongo bal ma bedo i iya aye tiyo.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Ma omiyo dong onen bota macalo cik ni, ka amito tiyo gin ma atir, ci gin marac nyiko cok kweda. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Pien amaro kwano cik pa Lubanga, kun alwodo loke ki iya. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ento dok aneno cik mukene i dul koma ducu, kun tye kalweny ki cik ma itama, tera i opii me cik me bal ma bedo i dul koma ducu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />An ma koma kec kumani, anga ma bilara ki i mitina me kom man ma tera woko i toni? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Apwoyo Lubanga pi Yecu Kricito Rwotwa! Dong an kikoma aworo cik pa Lubanga ki tama, kun ikoma ma kinywala kwede aworo cik me bal.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kwo i Cwiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Pimeno, kombedi pe dok kingolo kop loyo jo ma gilubu Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Pien cik pa Cwiny mamiyo dano kwo i Kricito Yecu dong ogonya woko ki ite Cik me bal ki to. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Gin ma onongo Cik pe twero tiyo, pien kwowa me anywali onongo oloko odoko goro, Lubanga aye madong otiyo. En ooro Wode kikome me bino ikit kom ma cal ki mewa ma bal obwoyo wokoni, macalo gitum ma kityero bot Lubanga pi bal. Kombedi dong en ongolokop oloyo bal ma tiyo ki kwowa ma kinywalowa kwedeni woko. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Lubanga otimo man wek gin ma atir ma cik mito ocobe ikomwa, wan jo ma pe dong walubu kit me kwowa me anywali, ento wakwo i yo ma Cwiny Maleng mito. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Pien jo ma bedo i kwo me anywali pa dano, giketo tamgi bene ikom gin ma lubu kit kwo me anywali pa dano; ento jo ma gibedo i kwo me kit pa Cwiny Maleng giketo tamgi bene ikom gin me Cwiny. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Keto tam i yo me kwo me anywali pa dano en aye to, ento keto tam i yo me kwo me kit pa Cwiny Maleng en aye kwo ki kuc. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Pien tam ma kiketo i kwo me anywali pa dano bedo me adagadaga ikom Lubanga, pien pe winyo cik pa Lubanga, pe bene twero lubune. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Jo ma gibedo kun gilubu kit yo me kwo me anywali pa dano pe gitwero yomo cwiny Lubanga.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ento wun pe wutye ikit kwo me anywali pa dano, wun wutye i kwo me Cwiny, kace Cwiny pa Lubanga bedo i iwu. Ngat mo ma pe ki Cwiny pa Kricito, nongo en pe dano pa Kricito. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ento ka Kricito tye i iwu, kadi bed komwu to pi bal, ento cwinywu bedo kwo, pien yam dong kikwanowu woko ni kitwu atir. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Kor 3:16</ref></char></note> Kace Cwiny pa ngat ma ocero Yecu ki ikin jo ma otoni bedo i iwu, en Ngat ma ocero Kricito Yecu ki ikin jo ma otoni bene bimiyo kwo kadi wa ikomwu ma to wokoni, pi Cwiny mere ma bedo i iwuni.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Ma omiyo utmegina, watye ki banya, ento pe me lubu kit kwo me anywali pa dano. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Pien ka wubedo kun wulubu kit kwo me anywali pa dano ci wubito; ento ka wugiko tic me kwo me anywali pa dano woko pi Cwiny Maleng, ci wubibedo jo makwo. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Pien jo ducu ma Cwiny pa Lubanga telogi, gin aye lutino pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:5-7">Gal 4:5-7</ref></char></note> Yam pe onongo wugamo cwiny me bedo opii, wek wudok cen ilworo; ento wugamo cwiny me bedo lutino pa Lubanga, ci pi tek pa Cwiny pa Lubanga omiyo wan wakok bote ni, “Abba! Wora!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:6">Gal 4:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Cwiny Maleng kikome aye ribe ki cwinywa kun tucu ni wan lutino pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Ka dong wan lutino Lubanga, ci wan bene wabinywako lonyo pa Lubanga ma pe tum kacel ki Kricito, kace waciro can kacel kwede, wek bene walim deyo kacel kwede.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Deyo ma binen i anyim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Angeyo ni can me kare man pe myero gipor ki deyo ma kibinyutu botwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Pien jami acweya ducu gitye kakuru nyute pa lutino pa Lubanga ki miti madwong ma okato kare. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Aca 3:17-19</ref> </char></note> Jami acweya ducu onongo yam kiketogi ite twero me gin ma tere peke, pe pi mitigi ken gi, ento pi miti pa Lubanga mayam oketo ite twero meno kun en geno ni <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />ceng mo kibigonyo jami acweya ducu woko ki i opii me to, wek gunong kuc ki deyo ma kimiyo ki lutino pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Wangeyo ni jami ducu ma kicweyogi acweya, gubedo kacur acura ki arem nio wa ikareni. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2 Kor 5:2-4</ref> </char></note> Pe gin keken, wan bene ma kimiyowa Cwiny Maleng macalo mot mukwongo, ma nyutu gin ma kibimiyowa i anyim, wan bene watye kacur acura ki i iwa kun wakuru kare me lokowa wek wadok lutino pa Lubanga, en aye me koko komwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Pien yam kilarowa pi bedo ki gen man. Pimeno gen ma kome nen nongo pe dong gen. Anga ma geno gin ma en neno kome? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ento kace watye ki gen me nongo gin ma pe waneno kome, ci wakuru gin meno kun wadiyo cwinywa.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ikit acelu Cwiny Maleng bene konyowa kama wagoro iye. Pe wangeyo lego Lubanga ikit ma myero waleg kwede, ento Cwiny kikome bako doge ma kakawa, ki cur ma lokdog pe twero waco. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Ngat ma ngiyo cwiny dano ngeyo tam pa Cwiny Maleng, pien Cwiny Maleng bako doge pi jo pa Lubanga kun lubu gin ma Lubanga mito.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Wangeyo ni i gin ducu Lubanga tiyo pi kelo gin maber ki jo ducu ma gimare, jo ma en olwongogi kit macalo en oyubu. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Jo mayam en ongeyogi con, omoko bene ni myero guloke wek gukwo calo Wode, wek omii Wode obed latin kayo ikin utmego mapol. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Jo mayam en oyerogi con, gin aye bene en olwongogi, jo ma en olwongogi, en bene okwanogi ni kitgi atir; jo madong en okwanogi ni kitgi atir en bene omiyo deyone botgi.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mar pa Lubanga matye i Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Wabiwaco ango mono dok ikom lok man? Ka Lubanga tye tung botwa, ci anga ma lakworwa? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />En yam pe okwero jalo Wode kikome ento omiye pi wan ducu. Dong pe en bimiyowa jami ducu kacel kwede? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Anga mono ma bikelo adot ikom jo ma Lubanga dong otyeko yerogi? Lubanga aye ma kwanogi ni kitgi atir. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Anga kono matwero ngolo kop loyowa? Pe tye ngat mo! Pien Kricito Yecu mayam oto, dok bene yam kicere woko, en tye obedo i kabedo me deyo kanget Lubanga tung acuc, en aye ma bako doge pirwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Anga ma bipokowa ki ikom mar pa Kricito? Neno can, nyo kumu, nyo ayelayela, nyo kec, nyo bedo munero, nyo gin marac, nyo pala lucwan? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">Jab 44:22</ref></char></note> Kit macalo yam kicoyo kwede kit man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Kibedo kanekowa dyeceng jwi piri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">kiterowa macalo romi me aneka.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Ento i gin magi ducu watye kaloyogi matek pi ngat ma ceng omarowani. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:15">Kol 2:15</ref></char></note> Pien angeyo ada ni, kadi to, kadi kwo, kadi lumalaika, kadi luloc, kadi gin matye ikare man, kadi gin ma mito bino, kadi teko, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />kadi gin matye malo, kadi gin matye piny, kadi ki gin mo keken ikom ginacweya ducu, pe bibedo ki twero mo me pokowa woko ki ikom mar pa Lubanga matye i Kricito Yecu Rwotwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga yam oyero Jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Atye kaloko lok ada i Kricito, pe aloko goba; ngec ma i cwinya moko lok man ki tek pa Cwiny Maleng ni, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />atye ki cwercwiny madit kun cwinya rem mada ma pe juke <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />pi utmegina, ma gin wadina me roka. Pi mitina kekena, kono yam kiceno an kikoma woko, wek kikwanya woko ki bot Kricito. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Nia 4:22</ref></char></note> Gin Jo Icrael, jo ma Lubanga olokogi gudoko lutinone, omiyogi deyone ki gicikene, omiyogi bene Cik ki kit yo ma myero guwore kwede, ki cikene pirgi. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Kwariwa macon ducu yam gubedo meggi, dok Kricito bene kinywalo ikin gi calo dano adana. Myero kipwo Lubanga maloyo jami ducu nakanaka. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Ento pe teloke ni, lok pa Lubanga pe otiyo gin mo; pien jo ma kinywalo ikin jo Icrael pe gin ducu jo Icrael. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Aca 21:12</ref> </char></note> Dok bene pe likwayo pa Abraim ducu gubedo nyikwaye me ada, pien yam kicoyo ni, “Likwayo pa Icaka aye kibilwongogi ni likwayu.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Man teloke ni, pe lutino ma kinywalogi ikit pa dano ma gin aye gibedo lutino pa Lubanga, ento lutino ma kinywalogi pi cike pa Lubanga aye kilwongogi ni gin likwayo. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Aca 18:10</ref> </char></note> Pien Lubanga ceng ocike bot Abraim kun waco kuman ni, “Abidwogo ikare macalo man, ka dong dakoni Cara binywalo latin awobi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Pe meno keken, gin ma calo man bene otime ikare ma Labeka ogamo ic pa lutino rudine ki laco acel, ma en aye kwarowa Icaka. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Ento ma pud peya onywalo lutinone, dok bene ma peya gutiyo gin mo maber nyo marac, wek omii yub pa Lubanga me yer omede, pe pi tic ento pi lwongone, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Aca 25:23</ref></char></note> kiwaco bot Labeka ni, “Latin matidi biloyo latin kayo.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mal 1:2</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 1:3">3</ref> </char></note> Kit macalo kicoyo ni, “Yam amaro Yakobo, ento akwero Ecau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Wan dok wabiwaco gin ango? Wabiwaco ni Lubanga pe ngolo kop atir dok kakare? Pe kitmeno! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Nia 33:19</ref> </char></note> Pien yam owaco bot Moses ni, “Abitimo kica bot ngat ma abitimo kica bote, dok bene abinyutu bera bot ngat ma abinyutu bera bote.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Kumeno, pe cung ikom gin ma dano mito, nyo ikom tice ma en cane pire, ento cung ikom kica pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Nia 9:16</ref></char></note> Pien ginacoya waco bot Parao ni, “Atingi malo pi lok man wek omii anyut tekona ikomi, wek nyinga oywek iwi lobo ducu.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Kitmeno en timo kica bot ngat ma en mito ni etime kica, dok bene dingo cwiny ngat ma en mito doko nwang.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akemo pa Lubanga ki kicane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Gwok nyo ibipenya ni, “Pingo mono Lubanga pud yenyo bal ikomwa? Nga matwero gengo gin ma en mito?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Ica 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref></char></note> Ento in dano adanani in anga, ma igamo dog Lubanga? Gin ma kicweyo acweya twero penyo ngat ma ocweye ni, “Pingo icweya kuman?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Itamo ni lacwec peke ki twero ikom lobo me cweyo atabo acel me wel ki mukene ma pe me wel, kun tiyo ki lobo ma en ongino angina acel madit? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Kadi bed Lubanga onongo mito nyutu akemone ki tekone ikom jo ma gubalo, ento en odiyo cwinye pi kare malac ikom jo mogo madong guromo me aneka woko. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />En otimo man wek omii lonyo me deyone ongene ikom jo ma en bitimo kica ikomgi, ma en yam oyubu wa con wek gunong deyone. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Man aye wan kikomwa, wan jo ma en olwongo, pe ki ikin jo Icrael keken, ento kadi wa ki ikin Lurok ducu bene. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Koc 2:23</ref></char></note> Kit macalo yam en oloko i buk pa Kocea ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Jo mayam onongo gin pe jona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">abilwongogi ni, ‘Jona,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">dako ma onongo yam pe amaro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">abilwongo ni, ‘Me Amarana.’<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 1:10">Koc 1:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Dok bene i kabedo kama yam kiwaco botgi iye ni, ‘Wun pe wujona,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">kibilwongogi iyeni, ‘Lutino pa Lubanga makwo.’”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:22">Ica 10:22</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 10:23">23</ref></char>
    </note> Icaya bene yam oloko lok ikom Icrael ni, “Kadi wel jo Icrael obed rom ki kweyo me dog nam, jo mogo manok ki ikin gi ma gudong aye gibibwot. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Pien Rwot bingolo kop iwi lobo, bicobo bene woko oyotoyot.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Ica 1:9</ref> </char></note> Dok tye kit macalo yam Icaya oloko nebi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Kono nene Rwot me mony pe oweko botwa likwayo mogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">kono wabedo calo Codom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">kono dong wadoko calo Gomora.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Icrael ki lok me Kwena Maber</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Wan dok wabiwaco gin ango? Wabiwaco ni Lurok mayam pe guyele pi doko jo ma kitgi atir dong kikwanogi ni kitgi atir, ento kitgi ma atir meno gunongo pi niye. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Ento jo Icrael mayam guyele pi lubu Cik ni wek gibed jo ma kitgi atir, pe gutwero cobo gin ma cik mito. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Pingo? Pien pe gubedo kayenyone i yo me niye, ento gubedo kayenyone calo gin ma ocung ikom lubu Cik. Guyoke ki got ma yoko dano. <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Ica 28:16</ref> </char></note> Kit macalo kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Nen, dong aketo got ma yoko dano i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">ariya mamiyo dano poto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Ento lewic pe bimako ngat ma oye en.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Utmegina, gin ma amito ki cwinya ducu ma alego Lubanga pire, en aye ni myero Jo Icrael gulare. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />An abedo caden gi kun angeyo ni gumoko matek ikom Lubanga, ento kadi bed gumoko, ci pe gucung i ngec kikome. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Onongo pe gingeyo kit ma Lubanga kwano kwede dano ni kite atir, ento gubedo kayenyo ni gitwero nongo kit ma atir pirgi ken gi, pe gumine ken gi ikit ma atir ma Lubanga miyo. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Pien cik dong ogik woko i Kricito, wek omii jo ma ye en kikwangi ni kitgi atir.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lare tye pi jo ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Moses yam owaco ni dano ma tiyo tic ma atir ma cik mito, bikwo pire. <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Nwo 30:12-14</ref> </char></note> Ento kit ma atir ma kinongo pi niye loko kit man ni, “Pe ilok kekeni ni, ‘Anga ma biyito malo ipolo?’ (ni, me kelo Kricito piny) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Nyo ni, ‘Anga ma bidonyo i bur ma tere pe gik?’” (ni, me kelo Kricito woko ki ikin jo ma oto) <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Ento man waco gin ango? Waco ni, “Lok pa Lubanga dong tye cok kwedi, tye i dogi ki i cwinyi bene,” ma en aye lok ikom niye ma watito pireni. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Pien ka itucu ki dogi ni, “Kricito aye Rwot,” ma kun iye bene ki i cwinyi ni Lubanga yam ocere woko ki ikin jo ma oto, ci ibilare. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Pien dano ye ki cwinye, en aye miyo kikwane ni kite atir, ka dok tucu ki doge ka dong miyo Lubanga lare. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Ica 28:16</ref> </char></note> Pien coc mayam kicoyo i ginacoya waco ni, “Ngat ma ye pe kibiweko lewic mako en.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Apokapoka mo peke ikin Lujudaya ki jo Grik; gin ducu Rwotgi acel, en bene poko lonyone bot jo ducu ma kok bote. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Joe 2:32</ref> </char></note> Yam kicoyo ni, “Jo ducu ma gilwongo nying Rwot kibilarogi.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Ento dano gibikok bote ningning, ma peya guye en? Gitwero ye en kono ningning ka pe guwinyo lok ma kitito ikome? Gitwero winyo lok ikome ningning ka ngat mo pe ma tito loke botgi? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Ica 52:7</ref> </char></note> Dano gitwero tito lok ningning ka pe kiorogi? Kit macalo yam kicoyo ni, “Neno tyen gi ber rom mene jo makelo lok me Kwena Maber!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ento pe gin ducu yam guye lok me Kwena Maber; pien Icaya yam oloko ni, “Rwot, anga mayam oye lok ma wan watito?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Adada, niye bino pi winyo lok ma kitito, lok ma kiwinyo a ilok ma kitito ikom Kricito.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:4">Jab 19:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Ento kong amito apeny ni, “Onongo yam pe guwinyo?” I ada guwinyo gire, kit macalo yam kicoyo i Jabuli ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Dwon gi winye teretere iwi lobo ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">ki lok ma giloko oo wa i agiki piny.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Dok apenyo ni, “Jo Icrael mono yam pe guniang?” Moses aye ma okwongo waco ni, “Abimiyo nyeko makowu ikom jo ma pe gin rok kikome, abimiyo kiniga makowu ikom rok maming.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:1">Ica 65:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Icaya dok cwinye obedo tek me waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Jo mayam pe giyenya dong gunonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">dong bene atyeko nyute woko kamaleng bot jo ma onongo pe gipenyo pira.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:2">Ica 65:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Ento ikom jo Icrael en owaco ni, “Yam abedo karyeyo cinga dyeceng jwi bot jo ma pe giwinyo doga, jo ma gin pyem kweda.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Kica pa Lubanga ikom Jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Pili 3:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Apenyo ni, “Lubanga mono dong okwero jone woko?” Pe kitmeno gire. An kikoma bene an Laicrael, lakwar Abraim, ma i kaka pa Benjamin. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Lubanga pe okwero jone mayam en oyerogi con. Pe wungeyo gin mayam kicoyo i ginacoya ma oloko lok ikom Eliya, kit ma en obako kwede doge bot Lubanga ikom jo Icrael ni, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Luk 19:10</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref> </char></note> “Rwot, dong guneko lunebini woko, gumuku keno tyeri gu woko ducu, an kena aye dong adong, dok bene gimito neka woko.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Luk 19:18</ref> </char></note> Ento Lubanga yam odoke iye gin ango? En odoke iye ni, “Pud aweko jo alip abiro gudong bota, ma peya gurumu conggi inyim Baal.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />I kit yo acelu tye jo mogo ikare man ma gudong, ma Lubanga oyerogi pi kicane. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ci ka kiyerogi pi kica, man nongo dong pe ocung ikom timo gin ma cik mito; ka nene onongo ocung ikom tic ma dano otiyo, kono kica dong pe kilwongo ni kica.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Gin ango dok kono? Jo Icrael pe gunongo gin ma gubedo kayenyone. Jo ma kiyerogi keken aye gunongo, ento jo mukene onongo wigi odoko dit woko, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Nwo 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Ica 29:10</ref> </char></note> kit macalo yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“Lubanga dong omiyo botgi dingwic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">omiyogi wang ma pe neno piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">ki it ma bene pe winyo lok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">kadi wa onyo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:22">Jab 69:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 69:23">23</ref> </char>
    </note> Daudi bene waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Wek karamagi ma gicamoni otyekgi woko macalo owic ma makogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">wek obed gin mamiyo gipoto i bur pi culu wang balgi.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Mii wanggi ocor woko, wek pe gunen piny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">mii pyergi ogom woko matwal.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Dok apenyo ni, “Ikare ma jo Icrael yam guyokeni, gin mono gupoto woko matwal?” Pe kitmeno! Pi balgi omiyo lare bene dong obino bot Lurok, wek omii nyeko omak jo Icrael. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ka balgi dong okelo lonyo bot lobo, dok bene ka potogi okelo lonyo bot Lurok, bere dong bibedo rom mene ka gin ducu gudwogo woko liweng?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lare obino bot Lurok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Kombedi atye kalok kwedwu, wun Lurok. Dong kit macalo an lakwena kwede bot Luroki, abidworo tica, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />wek gwok nyo amii nyeko omak jo me roka, ka wek alar jo mogo ki ikin gi. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Kace pi kwerogi woko omiyo Lubanga odwoko lobo ducu bote; ci dong bibedo ningning ka oye me gamogi kun jologi? Pe itamoni bibedo calo miyo kwo bot jo ma oa ki ikin jo ma oto? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ka kinywango moko me mugati, ce kikwanyo dule mukwongo ci kityero calo gin me wi mwaka bot Lubanga, ci moko ma odonge ducu nongo dong mere bene; dok bene ka kityero lwit yat bot Lubanga, ci nongo jange ducu bene gibedo mere kitmeno.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Ento kace jange mogo gituru woko ki ikom yat jeituni mabere, ka dong kijako jang yat jeituni mo me tim, ci kicomo kakagi wek omok i tyen yat maber ca, ka dong cako nywako ywayo pige mamiyu ma a ki ilwite. Jang yat ma gijako ki i tim ca en aye in; <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />ento pe myero iwake ikom jange mukene ca. Kadi bed iwake, pe in aye ma itingo lwite, ento lwite aye ma otingi. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ibiwaco ni, “Yam kituru jange mogo ni wek kicoma ikom yat.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Adada, yam giturugi woko pien gin pe guye Lubanga, in pud icung pien niyeni tye. Pe myero ibed ki tam me wake, ento bed ki lworo. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ka Lubanga yam pe oweko Lujudaya ma gin jang yat kikome, ci dong wutamoni en pe biwekowu? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Kong inen kica pa Lubanga ki gerone. En ger ikom jo ma gupoto woko, ento nyutu kicane boti, ka imede kun icung i kicane. Ka pe, kibitongi woko bene. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Dok gin Lujudaya bene ka guweko bedo labongo niye, ci kibidwokogi ikom yat; pien Lubanga tye ki twero me dwokogi iye. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Pien in Larok irom ki jang yat jeituni me tim ma kitongo woko ci kicomo ikom jeituni mabere, mayam onongo pe olot ikom yat jeituni ma kipito apita. Pe bedo yot tutwal bot Lubanga me dwoko jang yat mukene ca ikom yat kikome mayam kiturugi ki iye ni?<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bidwoko jo Icrael bote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Utmegina, tye mung mo ma amito wunge, wek omii pe wutam kekenwu ni wuryek; man en aye ni, jo Icrael cwinygi ongil pi kare mo manok, nio ka wel Lurok biromo. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Ica 59:20</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:21">21</ref> </char></note> Lacen dong Lubanga bilaro jo Icrael ducu, kit macalo yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Lalar bibino kun a ki i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">en bikwanyo kit ma kwero lworo Lubanga woko ki bot Yakobo.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 27:9">Ica 27:9</ref> </char>
    </note> Man aye gicike ma abiketo kwedgi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">ikare ma abikwanyo balgi woko.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Dong pi lok ma dok ikom lok me Kwena Maber, gin gudoko lukwor pa Lubanga pirwu, ento pi lok ma kemo yer, Lubanga marogi pi kwarigi. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Mot me kica pa Lubanga, ki lwongone, pe twero loke. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Yam pe wuwinyo dog Lubanga, ento kombedi dong en otimo kica botwu, ma onongo dong gin gukwero bedo ki winy woko ikome. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />I kit acelu kombedi dong gukwero winyo doge ikare ma en otimo botwu kica, wek omii gin bene kitim kica botgi kitmeno. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Piman Lubanga oweko dano ducu gudoko mabuc me bal pien gukwero winyo lok doge; en otimo man wek etim kica bot jo ducu.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimii pak bot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Lonyo pa Lubanga dwong ma okato kare! Ryekone kacel ki ngece tut tutwal! Lok ma en ngolo tere pe tate, niang ikite tek! <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Ica 40:13</ref> </char></note> Kit ma kicoyo kwede i ginacoya ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">“Anga ma ngeyo tam pa Rwot?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Anga mayam miye tam?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">En bikwanyo kit me kwero lworo Lubanga.<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:11">Yub 41:11</ref> </char>
    </note> Anga mono mayam kong omiye gin mo me mot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">ka wek en bene ocul wange bote?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 8:6">1 Kor 8:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Pien en aye yam ocweyo jami ducu, ci jami ducu yam obedo tye pire, dok bene obedo mere. Deyo obed bote nakanaka. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kwo matye i tic bot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Pimeno utmegina, abako doga botwu pi kica pa Lubanga; wumiine kenwu macalo gitum makwo ma kityero bot Lubanga, gin maleng ma yomo cwiny Lubanga; man en aye woro me cwiny ma opore bot Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Pe wulub tam me lobo man, ento wuwek Lubanga olok tamwu odok nyen, wek omii wuniang i gin ma Lubanga mito, gin maber, ma yomo cwinye, ma roc mo peke iye.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Pi mot me kica ma kimiyo bota atito botwu ducu ni, dano acel acel myero pe opar pi dite mukato kare, ento wubed ki par matye atir, kun ngat acel acel lubu kit pok me niye ma Lubanga dong opimo omiye. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:12">1 Kor 12:12</ref> </char></note> Watye ki dul komwa mapol ikom acel, dul kom magi bene pe gitiyo kit tic acel keken; <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />kitmeno, wan bene kadi bed wapol, wan kom acel i Kricito, ma dano acel acel bedo calo dul kom lawote. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4-11">1 Kor 12:4-11</ref></char></note> Watye ki mot mapatpat ma lubu gum ma Lubanga omiyo botwa; myero watii kwedgi. Kace kimiyo botwa mot me tito lok pa Lubanga, myero watit kit macalo niyewa tye kwede. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Kace omiyowa mot me tic pi dano, myero watii tic botgi. Ngat ma lapwony myero opwony dano. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Ngat ma cuku cwiny dano myero ocuk cwinygi. Ngat ma poko jamine, myero opok ki cwinye ducu. Ngat ma latel myero otel dano ki mitkom ki ngat ma konyo lucan, myero okonygi ki yomcwiny.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik mogo ma okemo kwo pa dano ma gilubu Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Wuwek mar ma wutye kwede obed mar me ada. Wukwer gin marac, wumok matek ikom gin maber. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Wumare kekenwu ki cwinywu ducu macalo omego, kun dano acel acel miyo woro bot lawote. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Komwu obed mit, labongo wackom, wubed lyet wa i cwinywu, kun wutiyo bot Rwot macalo lutice. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Wubed ki yomcwiny pi gen ma wutye kwede; wudii cwinywu ican, kun wumiine kenwu ilego Lubanga ki cwinywu ducu. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Wupok jamiwu bot jo pa Lubanga ma gitye ki peko; wuket cwinywu bene kagwoko welo.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luk 6:28</ref></char>
    </note> Wuleg gum ikom jo ma giunuwu; wulam gum botgi, ento pe wucen gi acena. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Wubed ki yomcwiny kacel ki jo matye ki yomcwiny, wukok bene kacel ki jo ma kok. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Car 3:7</ref> </char></note> Wubed ki niang ma atir ikinwu kekenwu; pe wuwake, ento wuribe ki dano ducu. Pe wukete kekenwu ni wuryek. <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Pe wucul wang gin marac ki gin marac ikom dano mo, ento wutam pi gin ducu ma dano ducu pwoyo ni ber. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Kace twere ki tung botwu, myero wubed ki kuc ki dano ducu. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Nwo 32:35</ref> </char></note> Luwota ma amaro, pe wucul kwor, ento wuwek kare ki kiniga pa Lubanga, pien yam kicoyo ni, “An aye ma abiculu kwor, abiculu wange lacen, man Rwot ma owaco.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21">Car 25:21</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:22">22</ref> </char></note> Yam kicoyo bene ni, “Kace kec neko lakwori, miye kwon ocam; dok ka orwo pii neke, miye pii omati; pien ka itimo kitmeno, bimiyo lewic make.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Pe wuwek gin marac olowu, ento wun aye myero wulo gin marac ki timo gin maber.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Woro luloc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Dano acel acel myero owiny luloc ma giloye; pien pe tye kit twero mo ma pe oa ki bot Lubanga; luloc ma gitye ni Lubanga aye oketogi. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Pimeno ngat ma pyem ki luloc nongo pyem ki ngat ma Lubanga oyero; kibingolo kop ikom jo ma pyem kwedgi. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Pien jo ma tiyo gin maber pe gibedo ki lworo mo ikom luloc, ento jo ma tiyo gin marac aye gibedo ki lworo. Imito ni pe ibed ki lworo ikom dano matye kaloc? Tii gin maber, ci en bipwoyi; <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />pien en latic pa Lubanga ma tiyo tice pi konyi. Ento ka itimo gin marac, ci myero ibed ki lworo ikome, pien twero me miyo pwod ikom dano dong kimiye woko. En latic pa Lubanga makelo kiniga pa Lubanga ikom jo ma timo gin marac. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />En ma omiyo myero wuwiny luloc, pe pi lworo kiniga pa Lubanga keken, ento pien meno aye gin ma omyero wutim. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mar 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luk 20:25</ref> </char></note> Man bene aye tyen lok ma omiyo wuculu mucoro, pien luloc gin lutic pa Lubanga ma gitiyo tic meno kikome. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Wucul gin ma myero bot ngat acel acel, wucul mucoro bot wegi mucoro, ki ajog bot wegi ajog, wulwor jo ma myero me alwora, wuwor jo ma myero me awora.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mar aye ma cobo cik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Pe wubed ki banya pa ngat mo ikomwu. Ento wubed ki banya me mare kekenwu; pien jo ma maro luwotgi nongo dong gucobo cik. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14-15">Nia 20:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Nwo 5:18</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Nia 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Nwo 5:17-19</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:15">Nia 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Nwo 5:19</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">d </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Nia 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Nwo 5:21</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">e </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref> </char></note> Pien cik mogo ma waco ni, “Pe i tim abor, pe ineki, pe ikwal, cwinyi pe opuke ikom jami pa ngat mukene,” ki kwayi cik mogo mukene gucoke kacel ki lok man ni, “Mar lawoti macalo imare keni.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Ngat ma maro dano, pe timo gin marac bot dano lawote; pimeno mar aye ma cobo cik.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Wutii man kun wungeyo kare ma wutye iye ni, kare dong oromo myero wuco woko ki iwang nino. Pien larewa dong onyiko cok tutwal, kato ma ikare mayam wakwongo ye iye Rwot ca. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Dyewor dong cok tum, piny dong mito ruu. Dong wabolu tic me piny macol woko, waruku jami lweny me dyeceng. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Myero walubu kit ma myero me dyeceng, labongo maro tuku marac me yomcwiny marac, ki mero, labongo timo abor ki tim mogo me tarwang, labongo daa ki nyeko. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Wuruk Rwot Yecu Kricito calo wuruku bongowu, dok bene pe wutam pi kwowu me kit pa dano ma kinywalowu kwede pi cobo mitine.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Pe ingol kop ikom lawoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:16">Kol 2:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Wujol dano ma niyene goro, ento pe wupyem kwede ikom tam mogo ma en tamo. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Dano mo twero bedo ki niye me camo gin mo keken, ento ngat ma niyene goro camo pot dek keken. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Dano ma camo gin ducu myero pe oca ngat ma pe camo, ki dano ma pe camo gin ducu pe myero ongol kop ikom ngat ma camo gin ducu; pien Lubanga dong otyeko jologi. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />In anga mono ma ingolo kop ikom latic pa ngat mukeneni? Meno lok pa ngat ma loye me ngolo kop ikome, ka cung nyo ka poto. Ento en bicung gire, pien Rwot tye ki twero ma miyo en cung.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Dano acel woro nino acel ni dit kato nino mukene ducu, kun nongo dano mukene tero ni nino ducu rom. Dano acel acel myero omok tame pire kene. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Dano ma keto woro ikom nino mo, miyo woro bot Rwot, ki ngat ma camo bene camo pi Rwot, pien pwoyo Lubanga; dano ma kwero cam bene kwero pi Rwot, pwoyo Lubanga bene. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Pien dano mo pe ki ikinwa ma kwo pire kene, dok bene dano mo pe ma to pire kene. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Ka wakwo, wakwo pi Rwot; ka wato bene, wato pi Rwot. Ma omiyo kadi wakwo, nyo wato, wan jo pa Rwot. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Pien Kricito yam oto ka dok obedo kwo wek ebed Rwot pa jo ma oto ki jo makwo.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Kor 5:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Pingo ingolo kop ikom lawoti? Nyo in, pingo icayo lawoti? Wan ducu wabicung inyim komker me ngolo kop pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Ica 45:23</ref> </char></note> Pien yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Macalo atye kwoni, man Rwot ma owaco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">jo ducu gibirumu conggi inyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">ki dano ducu gibitucu ki doggi ni an aye Lubanga.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Kitmeno, ngat acel acel ikinwa bidok ilok ma ikome pire kene bot Lubanga.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pe iwek lawoti opot i bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Myero dong wagiku ngolo kop woko ikom luwotwa; ento gin ma myero wamok en aye pe me tiyo gin mo ma bimiyo ngat mo yoke nyo poto i bal. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Angeyo dok aniang maber i Rwot Yecu ni, pe tye gin mo ma obedo me kwer pire kene; ento bedo me kwer bot ngat ma tamo ni obedo me kwer. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Kace imiyo lawoti bedo ki cwercwiny pi gin ma in icamo, nongo dong pe itye kalubu yo me mar. Pe iwek gin ma in icamo obal kwo pa dano ma Kricito oto pire. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Pe wuwek dano gulok ikom gin maber ki tung botwu ni obedo gin marac. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Pien ker pa Lubanga pe teloke cam ki mat, ento kit ma atir, kuc, ki yomcwiny ma Cwiny Maleng miyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Dano ma tiyo tic pa Kricito kitmeno aye yomo cwiny Lubanga, dok bene dano gipwoye.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Myero dong watim wunu gin makelo kuc ki gin ma dongo niyewa ikinwa kekenwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Pe wubal tic pa Lubanga pi lok me cam ma mwani. Jami ducu leng, ento bedo rac ka dano mo camo gin mamiyo lawote poto i bal. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Bedo ber mada ka pe icamo ringo, nyo kadi ki mato kongo, nyo tiyo gin mo ma bimiyo lawoti poto. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Dong niye ma itye kwede myero ibed kwede ikin in ki Lubanga keken. Tye ki gum dano ma pe ki tyen lok ma ngolo kop loye kekene i gin ma en pwoyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ento dano ma kalo akala i cwinye kop loye kace ocamo, pien gin ma en timoni nongo pe oa i niye, pien gin ducu ma pe oa i niye meno bal.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Tam pi dano lawoti pe itam piri keni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Wan jo ma watek myero wakonyu jo magoro i gin maloyogi, ento pe watamu pi yomo cwinywa kekenwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Ngat acel acel ikinwa myero oyom cwiny dano lawote, me konye, wek odong i niyene. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Jab 69:9</ref> </char></note> Pien Kricito yam pe oyomo cwinye kekene, ento obedo kit macalo yam kicoyo ni, “Ayet pa dano ma giyeti kwede dong opoto ikoma.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Gin ducu mayam kicoyo ikare macon ca onongo kicoyo me pwonyowa, wek wacir can, dok bene wek wabed ki gen pi lok me cuku cwiny ma wakwano i ginacoya. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Wek Lubanga ma ladii cwiny i ciro can ducu dok bene lakwe cwiny omiwu wubed ki niang maber ikinwu kekenwu, kun wulubu kit pa Kricito Yecu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />wek wuribe kapako Lubanga Won Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ki dwon acel.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Wujole wunu kekenwu, kit macalo Kricito yam dong ojolowu kwede, pi deyo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Atitiwu ni, Kricito yam oloke odoko latic ma okonyo Lujudaya, pi nyutu ni Lubanga loko lok ada, kun bene cobo gin mayam ocike iye bot kwariwa macon, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Cam 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Jab 18:49</ref> </char></note> dok pi miyo Lurok gubed kapako Lubanga pi kicane, kit macalo yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Pimeno abikori ikin Lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">dok abiwero wer me pako nyingi.” En ma omiyo myero wuwiny luloc, pe pi lworo kiniga pa Lubanga keken, ento me miyo wek wubed bene ma iwu leng.<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Nwo 32:43</ref> </char>
    </note> Dok yam bene owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Wun Lurok, wubed ki yomcwiny</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">kacel ki jone”;<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 117:1">Jab 117:1</ref> </char>
    </note> dok ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Wupak Rwot, wun Lurok ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">wek lwak me rok ducu gupake.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">Ica 11:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Icaya bene yam owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Lakwar Yece bibino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">en bibino kaloyo Lurok;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Lurok bene gibigeno en.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Lubanga mamiyo dano ducu bedo ki gen myero omii yomcwiny ducu ki kuc opong i iwu pi niyewu ikome, wek genwu obed kamede ameda pi tek pa Cwiny Maleng.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin ma omiyo Paulo ocoyo ki tekcwiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Angeyo atir ni wun jo mabeco tutwal, wutye ki ngec ma oromo, dok bene wutwero pwonye giwu kekenwu. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Ento dong atyeko coyo botwu lok mogo ki tekcwiny madit, pien amito apo wiwu iye. Atimo meno pi mot ma Lubanga omiya, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />me bedo latic pa Kricito Yecu bot Lurok. Atye katic macalo ajwaka pa Lubanga kun bene atito lok me Kwena Maber ma oa ki bot Lubanga, wek omii Lurok gubed calo gitum ma kityero ma Lubanga pwoyo, ma Cwiny Maleng dong olonyo woko odoko maleng. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Atye ki tyen lok ma miyo awake i Kricito Yecu pi tica ma atye katiyone pi Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Pe abiete kaloko lok mo mukene, ento kono pi gin ma Kricito otiyo pi kelo lurok ite loce keken, kun tiyo kacel kweda ilok ki i tic, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />ma a ki i teko ma onen ki ikom lanyut mogo ki tango mogo, pi tek pa Cwiny Maleng. Meno omiyo dong atyeko tito lok me Kwena Maber ikom Kricito atika, cake ki i Jerucalem, wok kwede wa i Illiriko. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Pien onongo aketo cwinya me tito lok me Kwena Maber kama yam dano peya guwinyo nying Kricito, wek omii pe aket gedo iwi guti mayam dong ngat mukene ocako gedo iye. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Ica 52:15</ref> </char></note> Kit macalo kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Jo mayam peya kitito botgi lok ikome dong gibiniang ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">jo mayam peya guwinyo pire gibiniang ikome.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yub pa Paulo me wot i Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:13">Rom 1:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Man aye gin ma obedo ka genga tyen mapol me bino botwu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ento kombedi dong pe atye ki katic mo kany, dok bene onongo dong abedo ka mito pi mwaka mapol ni abin botwu. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Ageno ni abinenowu ka awok ki kunu ma nongo akato acito i Spain, ageno bene ni wubikonya i wota me cito kunu lacen, ma nongo kong arii botwu pi kare manoknok. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ento kombedi pud kong acito i Jerucalem pi tero jami me kony bot jo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1 Kor 16:1-4</ref></char></note> Pien jo pa Lubanga ma gitye i Makedonia ki Akaya dong gumoko tamgi me jogo lim me konyo jo pa Lubanga ma gitye i Jerucalem ma can omakogi. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1 Kor 9:11</ref></char></note> Gumoko tamgi kitmeno, ento gitye bene ki banya bot jo Jerucalem, pien ka Lurok ginywako gamo mot me Cwiny kacel ki Lujudaya, myero gin bene gukony Lujudaya ki jami ma mite me gwoko kom. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ka dong meno otum, ma nongo dong atyeko miyo botgi gin ma kijogo pirgi, ci abiwok ki botwu ka dong akato acito i Spain. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Angeyo ni ka ao botwu nongo abino ki gum madit ma oa ki bot Kricito.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Abako doga botwu utmegina, pi Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ki pi mar pa Cwiny Maleng, wuket tek wuribe kacel i legawu pira bot Lubanga, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />wek abwot woko ki bot jo ma pe guye Kricito ma gitye i Judaya, dok bene wek omii dano pa Lubanga ma gitye i Jerucalem gupwo tic ma acito katiyone kunu. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Pimeno ka Lubanga oye wek abin botwu ki yomcwiny madwong, ci kong aywe bene kacel kwedwu. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Lubanga won kuc obed kwedwu ducu. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mot bot jo mapatpat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Anyutu botwu laminwa Phoebe, ma en latic pa lwak jo ma guye Kricito matye i Kenkeria. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Wujole i Rwot kit macalo jo pa Lubanga myero gujol kwede dano, dok bene myero wukonye igin ducu ma en bimito ki botwu; pien yam okonyo jo mapol, okonya bene.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Tic 18:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Wumot Pricika ki Akwila, ma gitiyo kacel kweda i tic pa Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Gin yam gudyero kwogi pi laro kwona; pe an kena aye ma apwoyogi, ento kadi wa Lurok ducu ma guye Kricito bene gipwoyogi. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Wumot bene jo ma oye Kricito ma gicoke i otgi. Wumot larema Epaenato; en aye obedo ngat mukwongo ye Kricito i Acia. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Wumot Maliam mayam otiyo tic matek ikinwuni. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Wumot Anduroniko ki Yunia, ma gin wadina mayam kitweyogi kacel kweda i buc. Gin jo ma gingene mada ikin lukwena, gin bene aye gukwongo ye Kricito ma onongo an pud peya aye. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Wumot Ampuliato, ma en larema ma amaro i Rwot. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Wumot Urbano latic wadwa i Rwot, ki Citakic larema ma amaro. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Wumot Apelle, ma en dano ma gene i Kricito. Wumot dano ducu me ot pa Aricitobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Wumot Kerodion ma en wata, ki jo me ot pa Narocico ma gitye i Rwot. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Wumota bene Terapaina ki Terpoca, ki larema Perici ma otiyo tic matek i Rwot. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mar 15:21</ref></char></note> Wumot Rupo, dano ma ngene i Rwot, gin ki mine ma alwongo ni maa bene. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Wumot bene Acinkerito, Pelegon, Keremec, Patroba, Keremac ki utmego ki nyimege ma gitye kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Wumot bene Pilologo ki Julia, Nerea gin ki lamine, ki Olimpa, ki jo pa Lubanga ducu ma gitye kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Wumote kekenwu ki mot maleng me mar. Lwak jo ma oye Kricito i kabedo mapatpat ducu gumotowu.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lok me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Abako doga botwu, utmegina ki nyimegina, wunen jo ma gikelo apokapoka i lok mamiyo dano poto i bal, ma pe rwate ki pwony mayam kipwonyowu kwede. Pe wuribe ki jo macalo meno. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Jo macalo meno pe gin lutic pa Rwotwa Kricito, ento rwotgi ma gimaro aye igi. Gibwolo tam pa dano ma gipe ki tam marac, ma kun nongo giloko lok maber ma winyone mit adada. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kit winy ma wubedo kwede bot Lubanga dong owinye bot jo ducu, meno aye gin ma omiyo wuyomo cwinya. Dong amito wubed luryeko i gin maber, ento myero wubed maleng labongo bal; <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />ci Lubanga won kuc binyoto Catan woko oyotoyot piny ite tyenwu. Kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed kwedwu.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Tic 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Temceo ma tiyo kacel kweda i Rwot omotowu; ki Lukio, ki Jacon, ki Cocipater, ma gin giwadina.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />An Tertio aye ma acoyo waraga man amotowu i Rwot.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:23: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Tic 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1 Kor 1:14</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 Tem 4:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Gayo ma en ngat ma abutu i ode bene omotowu, en aye ma gwoko lwak ducu ma oye Kricito. Eracto ma en lakan lim me gang man, ki ominwa Kwarto bene gumotowu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">[<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed kwedwu wun ducu. Amen.]<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega me pak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Myero wamii deyo bot Lubanga matwero miyo wucung matek, macalo apwonyo kwede ilok me Kwena Maber ma abedo katitoneni, ki lok ma kitito ikom Yecu Kricito ma mako mung man yam Lubanga okano oling woko litik pi lwak mwaka mapol, ka lacen dong oyabo kamaleng. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Kombedi dong kinyutu woko kamaleng i lok ma lunebi yam gucoyo ma omiyo lurok ducu gungeyo kit macalo Lubanga mabedo nakanaka yam ociko, wek omii gulub niye. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Deyo obed bot Lubanga nakanaka, ma en keken aye won ryeko, pi Yecu Kricito. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>